  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **I'm In Your Mind**: back after 30 archived shows (434 days) [3]\n- **Cellophane**: back after 30 archived shows (434 days) [3]\n- **I'm In Your Mind Fuzz**: back after 30 archived shows (434 days) [3]\n- **Automation**: back after 30 archived shows (434 days) [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2024-05-27.dankski** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 18 songs; 126 min [1]\n- **kglw2024-05-27**: source not stated; 18 songs; 125 min [2]. Said about its sound: A jam section is included in place of a drum solo during the performance [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Recorded from the left front corner, 8.5 feet away, using mics lent by chocobot [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2024-05-27.dankski**: taped by Dankski Vision; transferred by Teddy Dunskl; source: Zoom Matrix 24/48 [1]\n- **kglw2024-05-27**: taped by puffanug; transferred by puffanug; source: AT 4041 > PMD661 > wav [2]. Also: Recorded with AT4041 mics into a PMD611 recorder at 24/96 wav, then converted to flac [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Reverholic: [King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard Around The Fire They Circle Slow Limited Edition Poster Merch For Edinburgh UK At The](https://reverholic.com/product/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-around-the-fire-they-circle-slow-limited-edition-poster-merch-for-edinburgh-uk-at-the-usher-hall-on-may-27-2024-decor-poster-canvas/) [4]",
